            "review_title": "Review at Nha hang Mai Lam - Chua Huong",
            "review_text": "John H\nLondon, United Kingdom398 contributions\n0\nLunch after the pagoda visit\nNov 2018 • Couples\nStopped here for lunch after our visit to the Perfume Pagoda. In the way into the restaurant, you pass what looks like a fish tank which is full up with animals and snakes which are covered in rice wine. Our guide explained that the rice wine is flavoured by the animals and snakes.\n\nWe had chicken and noodles, with a bottle of water. Good was very tasty.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 20, 2018",
